  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving living conditions of EQ affected families by MCPA in Turkey  - Molham (DEC Ph2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome Z &#x2013; Families affected by the earthquake receive 250 USD one-off Multi-Purpose Cash Assistance&#xa0;


&#xa0;


Output Z1.1.1 - Families affected by the earthquake receive 250 USD one off cash assistance in Hatay (target 133 HH/ families)&#xa0;&#xa0;


Providing vulnerable families affected by earthquake who are living in harsh conditions and most in need in Turkey with MPCA. This will support the affected population with the agency to prioritise important sets of needs unique to their households.&#xa0;


&#xa0;


Output Z1.1.2 - Families affected by the earthquake receive 250 USD one off cash assistance in Kahramanmaras (target 137 HH/ families)&#xa0;&#xa0;


Providing vulnerable families affected by earthquake who are living in harsh conditions and most in need in Turkey with MPCA. This will support the affected population with the agency to prioritise important sets of needs unique to their households.&#xa0;


&#xa0;


Output Z1.1.3 - Families affected by the earthquake receive 250 USD one off cash assistance in Malatya (target 16 HH/ families)&#xa0;&#xa0;


Providing vulnerable families affected by earthquake who are living in harsh conditions and most in need in Turkey with MPCA. This will support the affected population with the agency to prioritise important sets of needs unique to their households.</narrative>
  </description>
